  "updated_at": "2026-07-30T15:35:45.400Z",
  "published_at": "2026-07-30T15:35:45.385Z",
  "id": 203719251139921,
  "uuid": "30805172-77a6-498e-a03e-9e5db6a779e6",
  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "be256f0d-11cb-7c4b-4411-7331bbceb951",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "91167539-b55e-4288-3da2-09c2370de3e8",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "How did you know about the Masters of Arts in Digital Journalism?",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "bold"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                },
                {
                  "text": "In late 2017, I saw adverts on the mainstream newspapers on the MADJ program and I applied.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "How was your learning experience?",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "bold"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                },
                {
                  "text": "I have enjoyed my learning experience at GSMC. The lecturers were always available and we had a blend of both scholars and practitioners taking us through the classes, which was quite helpful. The programme is very hands-on and it has made me an all-round journalist and communications professional.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "How did you balance your work, studies and family?",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "bold"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The work-study balance was not easy. I had to come up with a work plan where I would spend at least 1-2 hours daily on my classwork. That meant less sleep and sometimes juggling between work-related assignments and school work. The key to succeeding in this programme lies with the students' determination.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "What impact has the program had on your life and career path?",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "bold"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                },
                {
                  "text": "The programme offered me an opportunity to network with media and communications professionals and scholars. I have also learned how to craft an academic paper from scratch.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "What advice would you give someone joining to pursue the Masters of Arts in Digital Journalism?",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "bold"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                },
                {
                  "text": "My advice to all the students who want to join the programme is that they won't be disappointed. It is one of the best study programmes one can find around.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "What next for you now?",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "bold"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                },
                {
                  "text": "For now, my focus is on building my career. I also want to pursue a PhD as I work.",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
